    "body": "I got these from the link checker (line numbers are somewhat useless since they refer to the output document):\n\n```\n    https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px (lines 2711, 12983, 12984, 16074, 16077, 16078, 16979, 17197, 17199, 17327, 17329, 17771, 17777, 17778, 18375, 18640, 18642, 18651, 21185, 21192, 21227, 21228, 26923, 26924, 26926, 26935, 26945, 27128, 27129, 27130, 27142, 27157, 27323, 27328, 31796, 31798, 34552, 34557, 34559, 42481, 44195, 44742, 44744, 45303, 45427, 45462, 46264, 46402, 46405, 46442, 46446, 46456, 46462, 46471, 46476, 46487, 46489, 46493, 46496, 46499, 46502, 46841, 48326, 48451, 48455, 55231, 65516, 65546, 65551, 65766, 65773, 79084, 79246, 79257, 79322, 79327, 79336, 79339, 80057, 80058)\n    https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#vw (lines 2711, 17690)\n    https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#in (lines 2711, 17776)\n    https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#ex (lines 2711, 45332, 47923)\n    https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#em (lines 2711, 45332, 47923)\n```\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
